# SYNOPSIS

```text
protocol todhchai.radharc.Shortcuts version 11
call register(chord: Chord) throws(WindowError) -> UInt32
call unregister(id: UInt32)
event pressed(id: UInt32)
```

# DESCRIPTION

Global chords (`/svc/windows/shortcuts`, gated: a client with `grant
windows shortcuts` the user allowed), matched by Radharc before
focus and consumed: the focused window never sees them.

Protocol `todhchai.radharc.Shortcuts`, version 11, of library `RadharcIPC`, its messages in the one wire format (wire(6)).

| Method | Kind | Since | Ordinal |
| `register` | call | 1 | `0x2deeafef1840d840` |
| `unregister` | call | 1 | `0x157afaecf9976583` |
| `pressed` | event | 1 | `0x43f857bafe119045` |

: `register`
  Registers `chord`: its id; `invalid` if another holder has it.

